 after rebase onto published vibe22e10405. Display-part neighborhood checks pass for 15 forms. Markdown and oxlint self/copy recounts remain complete, identical and0flags.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m321\",\"epic\":\"e2\",\"rank\":271,\"title\":\"feat(tooling): census specification test evidence and pending coverage\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane coverage-census through mq-11031109-53 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m322\",\"epic\":\"e2\",\"rank\":272,\"title\":\"fix(tooling): place API probes inside the project root\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane api-identity-self through mq-11031119-54 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: 3/5 focused tests fail. After: root/opencode8/8 pass, including24 project-root option cases and24generic import-type cases; the assembled ambient/links/root source also passes8/8. Docs regeneration and forms--write pass with183kernel tests/25files and no changed form decisions.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m323\",\"epic\":\"e2\",\"rank\":273,\"title\":\"fix(tooling): reuse proven recursive generic identity bridges\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane api-identity-scale through mq-11031122-55 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m324\",\"epic\":\"e2\",\"rank\":274,\"title\":\"fix(tooling): preserve references during nominal API alignment\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane api-identity-self through mq-11031157-61 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: 3/3focused regressions fail. After:4/4fin