om lane sl21-fix-opus-5 through mq-11031123-56 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m916\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":459,\"title\":\"docs(user): add a real Alchemy provider, before and after\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (showcase-alchemy): rebased onto a444534a5dda, token counts regenerated.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m917\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":460,\"title\":\"docs(user, skill): plain VibeLang code never throws\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-spec): nothrow-impl tip carries the spec stack.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): same 15 commits plus the EK4616 thunk fix that keeps TestFixVIPRetiredHatchMapperByName green under EK0401.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): nothrow-impl a5a4eb52 carries this stack rebased onto main a4ec2e29, plus commits 7-9 (catch effect fixes, async parameter lists and detail 253, EK4401 fix vs EK0401).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): nothrow-impl fc52596df1fb carries this stack plus the PREVIEW-3/4/5 fixes and the EK0401 quick-fix contract guard.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane nothrow-impl through mq-11031318-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: ek4401-fix.fail, ek4401-fix-fixed (main.ts runs `hidden` as an Effect), TestForeignCallFix, foldkit-config-constrained-error.fail, foldkit-config-effect-calls.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case pair hatch-parameter-cell.fail / hatch-parameter-cell-fixed (the twin runs and returns what the hatches returned), TestFixVIPHatchKeepsParameterCell, and.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case nothrow-admitted-callback-escape.fail (escaping arrow, named function, object method, stored callback, called in place, passed to map, nested in an executor; controls), nothrow-known-throwing-call.fail moves its map-callback control to the errors, and.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m918\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":461,\"title\":\"test(docs): parse no-throw fence contexts instead of matching lines (PREVIEW-18)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): Carries all three tested no-throw follow-ups unchanged and adds the regression-tested parser fix that keeps regex literals opaque during effect modifier projection.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): Carries the tested PREVIEW-18 parser guard unchanged plus the five hatch admission rows and the passing LSP throw-expression fixture repair.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): The four earlier follow-ups landed in 631d8f6d830d. This rebased single-commit replacement retains PREVIEW-19 and avoids requeueing the published copies.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane nothrow-impl through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m919\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":462,\"title\":\"test(docs): parse no-throw witnesses with the VibeLang compiler (PREVIEW-19)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): Amended five-commit tip fixes PREVIEW-22 with before/after overload and function/class namespace regressions, nine-kind move fuzz coverage, and adds the method-decorator guard property.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): The rebased four-commit replacement retains all three tested native-parser guard fixes and adds the regression-tested no-throw TS-file/editor/automatic-fix implementation. Earlier copies must not be combined.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): Carries both completed guard commits unchanged and adds the independently regression-tested PREVIEW-20 field-decorator context repair. No native checker admission change is in this replacement.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (nothrow-impl): The replacement carries PREVIEW-19 rebased onto published vibe 4981999adec1 and adds the independently tested PREVIEW-21 source-token guard; the obsolete rebased copy must not be merged alongside it.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane nothrow-impl through mq-11031706-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: seed 9419 fails its first trial and shrinks to [0,0], path 0:0:0.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"After: 25 Node tests pass, including 400 fast-check trials; two existing fold-details text checks stay pending.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: seed 9821 fails its first trial and shrinks to value 0 and a single space.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m920\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":463,\"title\":\"test(docs): cover async declaration twin contracts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11031835-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m921\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":464,\"title\":\"fix(docs): check diagnostic identity across compiler and reference docs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane gate6-codes through mq-11031921-10 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 11 node tests pass; regeneration passes (183 kernel tests). docs:check still rejects inherited spec-page provenance text owned by the fold. Forms regeneration is running independently; no call-form inputs changed.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 16 focused node tests pass (650 mutation trials); regeneration passes, including 183 kernel checks. Appendix B rows remain in the separate fold-details handoff and the real-tree lint remains exclusive until folded.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m922\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":465,\"title\":\"fix(docs): retain rule evidence across spec deletions and rewordings\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane rule-evidence-deletions through mq-11032041-28 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 58 rule-evidence tests pass (seeded fast-check plus real compiler twins); 4 cited compiler cases pass. Regression tests fail against the old gate. Regenerated docs and forms; decisions differ only in source line numbers.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m923\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":466,\"title\":\"test(docs): fuzz Effect pin formatting and missing decisions\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (fuzz-findings): duplicate failed: Error: Change ID `vkuqsqky` is divergent Hint: Use change offset to select single revision: vkuqsqky/0, vkuqsqky/3 Hint: Use `change_id(vkuqsqky)` to select all revisions Hint: To abandon unneeded revisions, run `jj abandon <commit_id>`.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11032044-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: published 486bc00bd7f2 fails with TypeError; reverting only the matcher in the new suite fails all three tests. The corrected suite passes all three tests and 896 seeded models, with zero skips.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m924\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":467,\"title\":\"fix(docs): keep the Window and JSON logging snippets executable\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-pmfix-tail through mq-11032255-50 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m925\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":468,\"title\":\"test(docs): align census deletion evidence with the published contract\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-maint-sol through mq-11040629-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m926\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":469,\"title\":\"docs(user): rewrite Welcome, Why VibeLang? and Getting Started, simplify the home page (re-applied at vibe's tip by docs-push; token counts and site pages regenerated)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m927\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":470,\"title\":\"test(docs): retain the current sidecar overwrite guarantees\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fix-main-red through mq-11040739-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m928\",\"epic\":\"e3\",\"rank\":471,\"title\":\"test(docs): activate the published schema companion contract\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fix-main-red through mq-11040739-2 (matched by