ction\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: the directly imported forms fail the match-effect-tagged-aliases witnesses. After: all twelve guards, aliases, arity, rest and once-only evaluation pass. Implements VIP-7 and decided detail 53.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1859\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":827,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): accept object types in Effect error slots\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m1860\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":828,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): rescan adjacent Effect shorthand initializers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (ifix-func-r6): ifix-func-r7 recovery preserves the duplicate alias fix and both parser fixes, plus the tagged guards; four separate fix commits retain source/tests/docs and baseline evidence; 51 focused cases pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane ifix-func-r7 through mq-10311132-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1861\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":829,\"title\":\"fix(parser): allow line breaks in concurrent loop heads\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-run through mq-10311132-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1862\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":830,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): keep declaration sidecars out of loader cache inputs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (impl-hunt-func): Main already carries the sidecar-cache implementation and all four original cache-sidecars regressions, with additional generated-sidecar property coverage. Replaying the original new test file now produces duplicate imports.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1863\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":831,\"title\":\"fix