,\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1888\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":856,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): disambiguate exported types named as\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-data through mq-10311950-41 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1889\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":857,\"title\":\"fix(data): reject generic defaults with a preserving migration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (ifix-data-r4): ifix-data-r7 handover: independent current-main recovery, regenerated documentation and passing focused regressions.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (ifix-data-r7): Inherited recovery retains every regression/migration, aligned main owns the old registry row, escaped import repair and exact independently proved pending retirements; standard lost-edit guard, no force.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-data through mq-10311950-41 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1890\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":858,\"title\":\"fix(schema): expect independent required and readonly reference diagnostics\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-9f15 through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1891\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":859,\"title\":\"fix(diagnostics): keep factory result errors stable across argument edits\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vl-bugs through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1892\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":860,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): try runs a call whose result is an Effect subtype\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10312023-43 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case try-effect-subtype-calls runs a Config, a branded Effect, an interface and a generic Statement-shaped interface through try call and through a stored value, and catches the Statement's failure (on main it printed the unrun values); case try-effect-subtype-call-failure.fail is EK9201 for a contract that leaves out the Statement's failure (TS2339 on main, where try failing() was typed as the Statement).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1893\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":861,\"title\":\"perf(fix): trace importer errors to edited declarations\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vl-bugs through mq-10312036-44 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: original importer fixtures need13 checks and edited reporters hide their causal source; unchanged declarations and irrelevant chains exhaust the search budget. Eight regressions now pass, including the7-to4 causal-partition control.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1894\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":862,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): preserve tried Effect factory calls during VIP migration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fixvip-b through mq-10312242-48 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1895\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":863,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): drop try from calls to unannotated plain functions in VIP migration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fixvip-b through mq-11010046-53 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: TestFixVIPWritesEffect (unchanged, red on main) and the new TestFixVIPTriedCalleeKinds matrix (5 callee kinds x 4 positions, with and without a written try); the 8 plain-declaration cases fail on main. FuzzFix gets two keyed fix-vip-only corpus files for the neighbourhood.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1896\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":864,\"title\":\"test(vibelang): the corpus runs once, through the harness\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-opus through mq-11010127-56 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1897\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":865,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): drop try before plain-variant calls during VIP migration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fixvip-c through mq-11010215-57 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1898\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":866,\"title\":\"test(vibelang): run the Go package's binary as six processes at once\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fuzz-shards through mq-11010530-66 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: scripts/go-test-shards.test.mjs checks the target's wiring; it fails on main's PACKAGE.ts. 13 of 13 with go-vibelang-resources and fuzz-resources.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1899\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":867,\"title\":\"fix(fix): --fix-vip-only writes try before an effect arrow's body call (VIP-1, VIP-5)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane flip-codemod through mq-110