title\":\"fix(checker): declare an anonymous type met again as /*elided*/ any, as TypeScript 7.0.2 does\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11011331-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case declaration-recursive-inferred (a self-recursive builder, two builders that build each other, a method returning its own builder, in a TypeScript module the case runs), whose expected/lib.d.ts is TypeScript 7.0.2's output byte for byte; on main it fails with TS5088.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1925\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":893,\"title\":\"fix(checker): infer from type arguments on every visit, as TypeScript 7.0.2 does\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11011331-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case inference-union-pipe-requirements (alchemy's AuthProvider shape in a TypeScript module the case runs; expected/lib.d.ts is TypeScript 7.0.2's, provider requiring B); on main it fails with TS2345.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1926\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":894,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): chapter 2 owner codes EK2202, EK0202 and EK0201, and producer Streams without Scope\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-run through mq-11011331-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1927\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":895,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): separate await placement errors from advisories\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-9759 through mq-11011524-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}