ane main-red-trytry through mq-11011815-11 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1943\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":911,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): keep await advisories out of effect code\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-ek4609 through mq-11011850-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1944\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":912,\"title\":\"feat(declarations): vibelang.declarationImportStyle keeps a package's import spelling and quotes (C′)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: tspath unit cases per style; identity cases declaration-import-style-ts (Smithers), declaration-import-style-extensionless (opencode), declaration-import-quote-style (foldkit) and declaration-import-style-invalid.fail; TestDeclarationImportStyleMatrix (setting × quote × ./x.vibe/./x/./x.js/./x.ts × export *, export * as, import type, export {}, import() types, inferred types, added Effect import) against stock tsc 7.1's declaration of the .ts twin, byte for byte; flow property tests for importSpelling and addVibeLangSetting.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1945\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":913,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): one import per written effect import, and test inferred import types (foldkit-91, foldkit-92)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (declstyle-smithers): same stack rebased onto main 7b1a1d949081 plus 1dc154ca14f6: detail 263 default keeps written .ts specifiers; generated import types follow tsc for the twin (foldkit-92 nodenext).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: cases declaration-import-module-types (fails on the parent), declaration-import-style-inferred; Go TestDeclarationEffectModuleImports (quote x written import shape x added Effect, against stock tsc) and TestDeclarationImportStyleInferredImportType (style x quote x importer spelling).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1946\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":914,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): keep written non-.vibe specifiers under every style, and spell generated import types as tsc does for the twin (detail 263, foldkit-92)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (declstyle-smithers): carried by migfix-t3code 203a68317d9c (this stack duplicated onto main ff5457ea25db with the rules.md/context.md conflict resolved); declstyle-smithers is finished.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: cases declaration-import-style-default-ts-sibling and declaration-import-style-inferred-nodenext (both fail on bc96ebd5f8b4's binary with ./helper.js and import(\\\"../schema/index.js\\\")).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1947\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":915,\"title\":\"test(declarations): a .vibe module declares written specifiers as stock tsc does, in mixed modules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code): same 4 commits plus e48ab91c744c: sidecars.test.mjs pinned ./util.js for a written ./util.ts; stock tsc 5.9.3 declares ./util.ts (pre-gate compiler-test on 5b9e03af1142).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code): same 4 commits duplicated onto main ff5457ea25db; rules.md/context.md bullet merged with main's D298 text, token counts regenerated; box: Go vibelang+vibelangfuzz pass, cases 1045 ok (4 box/main-only), flow 297 pass (2 box-only), docs check pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1948\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":916,\"title\":\"test(sidecars): a .vibe sidecar keeps a written ./util.ts as stock tsc declares it\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11011850-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1949\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":917,\"title\":\"test(compiler): a tried Effect-subtype call or sql tag in statement position runs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11011850-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1950\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":918,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): a destructured typed catch binding no longer panics EK2112\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane core-land through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: case catch-retired-pattern (panicked on main 19f05597; now EK2112 and the program returns \\\"7\\\") and TestEditorQuickFixSkipsDestructuredCatch (object and array patterns). Claim crash:retiredcatch-binding-pattern (sl3-apply claim of 2026-10-31 lapsed; its stack was rejected).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1951\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":919,\"title\":\"fix(fix): an error whose message a fix makes more precise is not a new error\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-2): same fix on main f4782017: 6dbd492e conflicted in fix.go with fixperf-t3code's landed stack.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-2): same fix rebased onto main: c087339b no longer builds against main's fix_origins.go.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1952\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":920,\"title\":\"fix(fix): an error a fix's edit moves keeps its place in the gate\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code): same change restacked on migfix-t3code-2's 7bd74da7c12e (6dbd492e on main after fixperf's fix.go stack); the span placement now lives in the shared addedCounts.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestFixGateKeepsFixThatLeavesASiblingErrorAfterIt (the t3code module; --fix annotates both helpers and refuses nothing) fails on 6dbd492ecd80; TestFixGateRefusesAnErrorAfterTheEditAtANewPlace keeps a fix refused when its error after the edit lies where the file had none.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1953\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":921,\"title\":\"fix(prelude): a name an expression reads is its import, not an Effect module\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (manual): re-enqueued under lane migfix-opencode (enqueued without --lane).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case prelude-module-name-shadowed (fails before with that SyntaxError); FuzzPreludeShadowed over five bindings, eight module names, five forms and three uses, with the opencode programs as corpus (27 gaps before, none after); all 1001 cases pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1954\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":922,\"title\":\"fix(modulespecifiers): name VibeLang declaration types through package exports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m1955\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":923,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): name inferred prelude types under Preserve module emit\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1956\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":924,\"title\":\"fix(emit): name preserved native JSX outputs in runtime imports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1957\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":925,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): a .vibe module's sidecar prints an oversize inferred type in full\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestSidecarPrintsOversizeTypeInFull (a 30,000-property export through a generic call: the .ts control draws TS7056, the .vibe module emits with no error and declares the last property, and a stock consumer reads it precisely); FuzzSidecarFullTypes, keyed shapes (object, tuple, nested struct) of random size, whose oracle is stock TypeScript: equal declarations under the limit, the full type and no error over it, with corpus t3code-oversize-object and t3code-oversize-struct.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1958\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":926,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): a default-exported effect block declares its Effect, not a function\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: case default-effect-block runs a named and a default effect block and pins program.d.ts, which declared `function _default(): number` before this change.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1959\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":927,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): a default-exported effect arrow declares its Effect return\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code): same stack plus the function-declaration form in FuzzMigrationDefaultPrograms (test only).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: FuzzMigrationDefaultPrograms compiles each Effect TypeScript program form (Effect.gen, parenthesized, an arrow returning Effect.gen, a piped Effect.gen) as `export default` and as a named const with stock tsc, and its VibeLang form (effect { }, effect (n) => { }, the pipeline inside an effect block) with the compiler, and requires the migration gate's declaration identity.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1960\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":928,\"title\":\"test(declarations): the default-program fuzz covers an effect function declaration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1961\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":929,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): an effect function's channels read as Effect.gen's do\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case declaration-identity-effect-channels against its Effect.fn twin (main declares `import(\\\"./lib.js\\\").A | import(\\\"./lib.js\\\").B`): two aliases, a wider alias, another success, a subclass, a local helper.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1962\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":930,\"title\":\"test(compiler): react-native names a native .tsx output .js, as tsc does\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-jsx through mq-11012152-20 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1963\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":931,\"title\":\"test(compiler): follow the published source extension oracle\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane spec-lander through mq-11012213-21 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1964\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":932,\"title\":\"fix(module): a written ./x.ts that resolves to x.vibe is checked and rewritten as for x.ts (foldkit-113)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane declstyle-smithers through mq-11012213-21 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1965\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":933,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): preserve chained labels on native for-of loops\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane rc11-labels through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1966\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":934,\"title\":\"fix(match): preserve outer reads during binding renames\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-data through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1967\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":935,\"title\":\"fix(checker): an added optional property's readonly does not depend on check order\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: cases declaration-optional-never-order and its -swapped twin pin both functions' declarations in both orders (on main, read gains readonly after seed); FuzzDeclarationOrder compiles three random such functions forward and backward and requires each function's declaration to match, with corpus t3code-optional-never-readonly-cache.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1968\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":936,\"title\":\"fix(catch): a catch handler that is no function literal is EK0509, with a quick fix\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code): same change on main 4d8c221e8620; main ca2785acb46f already writes catch () => in tsforms_catch.go, so that hunk is main's.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestCatchHandlerEK0509QuickFix and -Parenthesizes pin each fix and that the result compiles; TestCatchHandlerFunctionLiteralsAdmitted keeps function literals clean.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1969\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":937,\"title\":\"test(compiler): an importer of a package sidecar export keeps its namespace alias in declarations\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1970\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":938,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): --fix keeps a thunk that holds a TypeScript call (VIP-4)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane codemod-alchemy through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: --fix prints \\\"EK4834 not fixed: ... EK4401: label is a plain TypeScript function\\\". After: no rewrite is proposed, nothing is refused.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1971\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":939,\"title\":\"fix(conversions): check union data members after call inference\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy-3 through mq-11012235-22 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1972\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":940,\"title\":\"fix(schema): lower and normalize TypeScript tuple forms\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (impl-hunt-data): conflicts with main in ltquzzwt: ltquzzwt STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: typescript/tsc/internal/vibelang/fix.go (AssertionError: ('typescript/tsc/internal/vibelang/fix.go', 'diff target found', 0, ['// accept returns proposals cut down to the fixes that, together, add no',).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-data through mq-11012318-24 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1973\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":941,\"title\":\"fix(diagnostics): Response.json names the global's globalThis.Response.json\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11012318-24 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1974\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":942,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): a data declaration declares what TypeScript declares for its Effect TypeScript counterpart\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (migfix-foldkit): conflicts with main in nqtwomux: nqtwomux STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: .smithers/flows/migrate/lib/declarations.mjs (AssertionError: ('.smithers/flows/migrate/lib/declarations.mjs', 'diff target found', 0, [\\\"// Declaration identity: a package's public API is its emitted .d.ts ).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-11012318-24 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case data-declaration-counterpart (declaration identity, byte for byte, with tsc's emit of the counterparts of foldkit's LazyMissReason, optional and written-readonly fields, recursion through the type and through ReadonlyArray/Record, and a generic data), failing on main 773bddb1d57f; the data-namespace-shadowing and data-generic-constructor-contract twins now write the counterpart as Effect TypeScript does; data-declaration, data-import and data-as-export expected declarations refreshed.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1975\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":943,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): tolerate absent loader temporary directories (opencode-58)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11020036-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1976\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":944,\"title\":\"fix(schema): preserve own __proto__ fields in schema declarations\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-fail through mq-11020036-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1977\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":945,\"title\":\"build(graph): key the migrate flow's package tests on every flow file\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-opus through mq-11020036-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1978\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":946,\"title\":\"fix(compiler): --fix writes try effect { … } for a yield* of a block (VIP-1)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane codemod-alchemy through mq-11020048-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1979\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":947,\"title\":\"fix(fix): a stopped --fix run exits at once, not after the check under way\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11020048-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: TestFixStopsDuringACheck signals the process from a program build that then blocks, and checks the run returns at once with its kept fixes, and that nothing is written or printed after. On main's fix.go and fix_keep.go it waits for the check and fails.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1980\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":948,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): an effect block writes Effect, as its Effect.gen twin imports it\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11020048-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestEffectBlockDeclarationNamesEffect (vibelangfuzz) compares the declaration of a .vibe module with its Effect TypeScript twin's under Preserve, ESNext and NodeNext, for a block, a block that reads a service, a block in an object, a default-exported block, a block in Layer.effect, a block with try, and an effect function control; 12 of the 21 fail on main.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m1981\",\"epic\":\"e4\",\"rank\":949,\"title\":\"fix(declarations): a TypeScript importer copies A!E without its empty slots\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11020048-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestImporterDeclarationOmitsEmptyBangSlots compares the