:\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-10310025-11 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3174\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":56,\"title\":\"test(vite): every Vite fixture runs no optimizer and closes before it goes\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fix-main-red through mq-10310125-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3175\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":57,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): a relative import of a file that is not a script reaches Bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10310603-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3176\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":58,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): vibelang/bun costs nothing for a dependency\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): conflicts with main in xnxztonz: xnxztonz STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: packages/compiler/test/bun.test.mjs (AssertionError: ('overlapping line edits', (0, 0, ['', '// ./prompt.txt names no script extension, so the resolvers look for', '// prompt.txt/index.ts, and Bun ).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10310650-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3177\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":59,\"title\":\"fix(lint): turn the Effect lints on only for an imported code's severity\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-10310743-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: TestOnlyAnImportedLintCodeTurnsTheLintsOn builds the drive's program under five configurations; the two with only VibeLang warnings fail on main and pass now. vibelang-cli.md says what turns the rules on.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3178\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":60,\"title\":\"refactor(knip): centralize rest-binding traversal\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint through mq-10310848-6 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3179\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":61,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): vibelang/bun resolves a tsconfig paths alias to .vibe\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-10310950-10 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: bun.test.mjs's alias test (extends with comments, @/a, @/a.js, a directory alias, a .vibe importer, a dynamic import, .ts priority) fails on main with Cannot find module '@/a'. paths-imports.property compares aliasImport with the compiler's own --traceResolution over generated trees, patterns, substitutions and inherited configs (60 runs, 150 checked locally), with an alchemy regression input.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3180\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":62,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): a schema field's type reference reads its codec\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-10311036-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: Go TestSchemaFieldReferencesReadTheirValues pins the projection (fails on main), and vibe.test.mjs lints the foldkit shape plus 60 seeded programs that place a codec reference in each mapped position (optional, readonly, ReadonlyArray, Array, T[], readonly tuples, Record values, unions, nested structs) of each schema form; on main each reports the codec unused.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3181\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":63,\"title\":\"fix(lint): check layer provision in functions named main (VIP-38)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-svc through mq-10311036-13 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3182\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":64,\"title\":\"test(loaders): fuzz opencode asset import layouts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migfix-opencode through mq-10311101-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3183\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":65,\"title\":\"fix(lint): honor ignoreEffect*InTscExitCode for imported EK38xx rules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the Effect-lint fuzz pass checks every program it lints against both filters with the three options on (no Effect diagnostic counts) and off (every one does), quoting chapter 7 (TestEffectLintConfigurationQuoted, in specTests); corpus witness FuzzCompile/effect-lint-smithers-ignore- exit-code fails without the fix (\\\"keeps 1 of 1 diagnostics (1 Effect), want 0\\\" for exit status and noEmitOnError) and passes with it.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3184\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":66,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): Bun resolves .js only for .vibe names\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): duplicate: f42517eab38f already landed in 9f4764d274e9.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3185\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":67,\"title\":\"fix(bun): keep createRequire's origin on a Bun that drops it under a CommonJS hook\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-10311936-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: property bun-create-require-origin (importer depth, working directory, URL/string/path/other-file bases, subpath exports, main, relative and parent requests; resolve and require) with regression alchemy-createRequire-origin, and a CommonJS require of a .vibe module by its extension; both run on VIBELANG_TEST_BUN as well as PATH's bun.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3186\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":68,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): resolve a .vibe paths alias to its declaration file as the compiler does\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-opus through mq-10311936-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3187\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":69,\"title\":\"fix(knip): an export's stub keeps the types its signature reads\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: knip.test.mjs gains the positions above; it and the updated module expectations fail on the previous stub.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3188\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":70,\"title\":\"fix(knip): an export stub keeps the JSDoc written before it\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10311936-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: \\\"an export's stub keeps the JSDoc written before it, whose tags Knip reads\\\" in packages/compiler/test/knip.test.mjs, failing on main's knip.mjs; property knip-export-jsdoc (knip.property.test.mjs), whose oracle is TypeScript's own JSDoc attachment on random modules of exports, comments, blank lines and same-line comments.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3189\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":71,\"title\":\"fix(lint): EK4805 offers no error declaration for an exported Error class\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10312023-43 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case ek4805-exported-error-class (both notes, and the class keeps its positional constructor at run time); flow test \\\"styleProblems leaves an exported Error class no error declaration can write, and rejects a local one\\\", which fails on main's library.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3190\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":72,\"title\":\"test(unplugin): the Bun filter property reads a queried id without its query\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migfix-opencode through mq-10312036-44 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3191\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":73,\"title\":\"test(vite,unplugin): wait for the holder to die, not for 200 ms\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3192\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":74,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): esbuild resolves .vibe from stdin's resolveDir, and a build from a directory without vibelang compiles\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane esbuild-flow through mq-11010815-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3193\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":75,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): esbuild resolves .vibe from stdin's resolveDir, and a build from a directory without vibelang compiles\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3194\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":76,\"title\":\"fix(vite): register also preloads vibelang/bun for a Bun process a test starts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: plugin.test.mjs starts a Bun child that imports a .vibe module (passes with register, fails without); plugin.property.test.mjs checks one --preload, inherited values first, idempotence. Vite suite 61/61.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3195\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":77,\"title\":\"fix(vite): leave a .vibe id with another plugin's query alone\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: the corpus build fails with MISSING_EXPORT and the property finds `?highlighted` compiled (2 of 4 fail); after: 4 of 4 pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3196\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":78,\"title\":\"fix(lint): skip the files Oxlint's ignore sources skip\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migtool-foldkit through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestCommandHonorsOxlintIgnoreSources builds foldkit's layout (`.git`, root `.gitignore` with `dist`, nested `.gitignore`, info/exclude, `.eslintignore`, `.ignore`, ignorePatterns) and checks each source, each flag, an ignored file named on the command line and the walk without a repository boundary; TestCommandIgnoresGeneratedOutputAcrossPaths ports drive-foldkit-ui's native-lint-coverage property (seed 53132, 30 nested and Unicode output paths, unprojected-source negative oracle; corpus <path>); TestParseIgnoreMatchesGitignoreSyntax covers the matcher.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3197\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":79,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): vibelang/bun leaves a bare specifier's resolution to Bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: 2000 iterations of Bun.resolveSync and import.meta.resolve of a bare package reach discovery fewer than 20 times (8002 with the old filter), and a module imported through a computed path still loads its extensionless .vibe import; a property over 500 generated relative, absolute and bare specifiers.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3198\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":80,\"title\":\"fix(lint): EK4805 offers no error declaration for an exported Error class\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case ek4805-exported-error-class (both notes, and the class keeps its positional constructor at run time); flow test \\\"styleProblems leaves an exported Error class no error declaration can write, and rejects a local one\\\", which fails on main's library.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3199\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":81,\"title\":\"fix(vite): a .vibe module's tsconfig path alias resolves\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: packages/vite/test/paths.test.mjs (a .ts target, a .vibe target, a directory index, an exact alias, a query, and the cases left to Vite), failing on main's plugin, and a check that the vendored copy is the compiler's.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3200\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":82,\"title\":\"fix(lint): EK4823 reports no effect block, whose braces are its syntax\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: case ek4823-effect-block.fail (single, nested, real arrow, arrow inside a block, effect arrow); on main it reports the three blocks too.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3201\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":83,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): leave Bun TypeScript resolution to Bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane bun-suite through mq-11010927-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3202\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":84,\"title\":\"test(bundlers): control compiler completion during teardown grace\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-f478 through mq-11011105-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3203\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":85,\"title\":\"fix(vite): ignore generated declaration events during hot updates\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane trailing-blocks through mq-11011602-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3204\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":86,\"title\":\"test(unplugin): stop a watcher's whole process group at once\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3205\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":87,\"title\":\"test(unplugin): replace tsconfig.json in one step in the watch test\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-opus through mq-11011624-6 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3206\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":88,\"title\":\"fix(bundlers): select VibeLang sources without duplicating mixed package modules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3207\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":89,\"title\":\"fix(lint): recommend native Layer dependency composition (VIP-24)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3208\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":90,\"title\":\"feat(loaders): run a package's .vibe source where its export names the emitted JavaScript\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: node and node --import vibelang/register, bun, bun --preload vibelang/bun (import, require, and the same instance through both paths), and bun build reading the JavaScript, on a minimized opencode workspace; both loader cases fail with main's hooks.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3209\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":91,\"title\":\"test(loaders): a .ts script reads one .vibe module by export and by path as one instance under vibelang/bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): Same B loader, flow and TS-script regression stack plus the tested opencode-50 mixed native export fix.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): opencode-35 had already landed; B and the opencode-46 test rebased onto main 4d8c221e8620 (steps.mjs platform conflict resolved), enqueue follows its tests.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): Same B loader, flow and TS-script regression stack plus the independently tested opencode-50 mixed native export fix.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3210\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":92,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): vibelang/bun rewrites a native importer synchronously, so require() loads it\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loadersync-opencode through mq-11021948-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3211\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":93,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): a cold process uses a package's committed loader record instead of compiling it\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (loadercold-opencode): loadercold-opencode restack: 588f + vite/unplugin oracle fix (6107af12995f) with loader records on top.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (loadercold-opencode): b5944dd81a67 landed first; only the flow-staging fix remains, as one commit on main.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loadercold-opencode through mq-11021948-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: corpus opencode-standalone-cold-emitted-js (bun --preload and node --import vibelang/register, cold, in place and in a moved checkout: 0 compiles with a record, 1 without; edits, added modules and config changes compile again; a type error leaves no record); a fast-check property over workspace names ($&, $$, backslash, regex characters), moves and eleven input changes (every change misses, none hits, paths relocate); the flow's emit writes a record a cold lookup accepts.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3212\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":94,\"title\":\"fix(vite): a cold dev server pre-bundles the imports a .vibe module's JavaScript adds\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vitescan-opencode through mq-11022001-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: dep-scan.test.mjs (drive2-opencode's reduction: scan found [] and effect/Schema late), the vite-dep-scan property over entries, barrel chains, specifier forms and generated-import features, and the opencode-generated-schema-import regression. scanServer in dev-server.mjs is the one test server that runs the optimizer.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3213\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":95,\"title\":\"fix(vite): under Vitest, the plugin adds no `module` condition of its own\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11022010-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: conditions.test.mjs runs Vitest on corpus smithers-otel-module-condition (a dependency with a bundler-only `module` export and a CommonJS default, imported from a .vibe module); it fails on main with the same error.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3214\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":96,\"title\":\"test(loaders): fuzz namespace captures during native rename and revert\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migfix-alchemy through mq-11022017-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3215\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":97,\"title\":\"test(loaders): fuzz script project selection under Node and Bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11022038-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3216\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":98,\"title\":\"test(vite): run alias properties through the shared dev server\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11022042-10 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3217\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":99,\"title\":\"docs(foldkit): compare four real migrated source excerpts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane docs-foldkit through mq-11022045-11 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: exact-source, append-only and scope-count proof fails before and passes after; snippets, docs:check, regeneration, token counts and forms pass. Self-contained service/schema snippets compile; incomplete excerpts use the existing fragment convention.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3218\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":100,\"title\":\"fix(bun): the preload's own tsconfig lookups no longer re-enter its CommonJS hook\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane tests-opencode through mq-11022108-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: a fast-check property over package, relative and array extends chains (1-3 links; paths own, inherited, none; builtin, node:, bare, relative and alias requests; resolve and require) that counts hook calls per require and checks every answer, plus the opencode layout as a saved regression (2,653 calls on main; 2 with the fix: the require and its one extends lookup).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3219\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":101,\"title\":\"test(loaders): fuzz script project selection under Node and Bun\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3220\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":102,\"title\":\"fix(bun): the preload's own tsconfig lookups no longer re-enter its CommonJS hook\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: a fast-check property over package, relative and array extends chains (1-3 links; paths own, inherited, none; builtin, node:, bare, relative and alias requests; resolve and require) that counts hook calls per require and checks every answer, plus the opencode layout as a saved regression (2,653 calls on main; 2 with the fix: the require and its one extends lookup).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3221\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":103,\"title\":\"test(unplugin): give the missing-project check a stage's guard\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11022336-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3222\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":104,\"title\":\"test(bundlers): cover delayed compiler teardown ownership\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fix-impl-hunt-data through mq-11022357-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 18 lifecycle tests pass; all four immediate-return mutations fail the new pending assertion. Regeneration passes 183 kernel tests; forms --write passes with no decision moves.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3223\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":105,\"title\":\"fix(lint): suppress declaration and incremental output (VIP-38)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane impl-hunt-svc through mq-11030000-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3224\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":106,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): hide synthetic pattern truthiness from lint rules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11030026-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3225\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":107,\"title\":\"test(eslint): distinguish effect modifiers from missing user names\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11030026-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3226\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":108,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): split adjacent generic opening tokens\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11030026-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3227\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":109,\"title\":\"test(bundlers): cover Alchemy workspace barrels under Bun and Rolldown\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11030119-10 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3228\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":110,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): retain captured is expressions as source forms\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11030122-11 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3229\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":111,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): exclude generated sidecars from Rolldown entries\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11030222-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3230\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":112,\"title\":\"fix(knip): preserve public markers across grouped exports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11030222-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3231\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":113,\"title\":\"fix(loaders): an emitted re-export has a default only when its source does; the migrate flow records packages after all routing\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loaderfix2-opencode through mq-11030257-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: opencode-emitted-namespace witness plus fast-check properties over default forms, export * and mixed .ts/.js/.vibe sources; opencode-loader-record-routing-order in both orders plus a three-package property over orders and import graphs (chains, cycles). All new tests fail on the parent.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3232\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":114,\"title\":\"fix(lint): preserve Unicode literal glob paths (RD-021)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane tooling-rd19 through mq-11030257-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3233\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":115,\"title\":\"fix(bun): resolve a module body's imports from its file's directory\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vip40conv-opencode through mq-11030735-6 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3234\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":116,\"title\":\"fix(lint): two .vibe ESLint false positives t3code reports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-2 through mq-11030744-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: Go TestTryTaggedTemplateIsTryCall; ESLint property (120 runs) and two regressions; flow fixture test and installed-Oxlint oracle. All fail on a444534a5dda and pass after.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3235\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":117,\"title\":\"fix(lint): EK4814 says decoding runs an overriding Schema constructor\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11030744-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: case schema-constructor-runs-on-decode runs the decode, so an Effect upgrade that changes this fails it, and expected/messages.txt pins the text.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3236\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":118,\"title\":\"test(eslint): require contextual variable binding nodes\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (fuzz-maint-sol): Minimal149 fix-forward is now based on published original147 and adds its own loop-symptom release note. Same source-span correction and all native loop/name regressions retained.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-maint-sol through mq-11030744-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3237\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":119,\"title\":\"fix(ast-grep): package and build registered JSX grammars\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vibex-estree through mq-11031109-53 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3238\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":120,\"title\":\"feat(eslint): support VibeLang JSX trees and linting\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (vibex-estree): Reviewed one-commit recovery of cc30c603f41d: every source edit is retained. Historical ancestry guard paths are outside the original unit, except generated site pages regenerated from current sources.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vibex-estree through mq-11031157-61 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3239\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":121,\"title\":\"test(eslint): exclude hoisted loop temporaries from binding checks\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-maint-sol through mq-11031214-64 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3240\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":122,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): represent effect blocks as program values\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: five Go value contexts and the minimized Smithers Egress corpus fail before the ESTree repair and pass after. A negative control without synthetic-reference cleanup fails no-unused-vars.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: all vibelangestree tests and vet; native property tests; docs regeneration and forms --write (no moved decisions) after independent rebase onto vibe. End-to-end passes. Broader ESLint is 19/20, with its sole no-unexpected-multiline failure independently reproduced without this fix.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3241\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":123,\"title\":\"feat(oxlint): run Oxlint's native rules on .vibe through the projected TypeScript\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (oxlint-vibe): conflicts with main in vxzwkrqp: vxzwkrqp STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: .smithers/flows/migrate/lib/tooling.mjs .smithers/flows/migrate/test/tooling.test.mjs docs/user/src/setup/developer-tools.md typescript/tsc/internal/vibelangmapper/project.go (AssertionError: ('overlapping line edits', (0, 1, ['\\\\tfileName, kind := projectedFileName, core.ScriptKindTS', '\\\\tif virtualExtension(ctx) == \\\".tsx\\\" {', '\\\\t\\\\tfi).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane oxlint-vibe through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3242\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":124,\"title\":\"fix(lint): scope form advisories to direct try consumers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane conf-auto-advisory-direct-consumer through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3243\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":125,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): exclude vibex sidecars from Rolldown entries\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vibex-bundlers through mq-11031448-12 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: the fixed regression and fast-check property fail with App.d.vibex.ts retained as an entry. After: 19 sidecar and glob tests pass, zero skipped. Includes 80 generated cases, source-contract quotes, docs and regenerated notes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3244\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":126,\"title\":\"fix(lint): run the five Effect rules on .vibe; count no try or catch as a pipe stage\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane toolfix-alchemy through mq-11031835-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: lint-oxlint-rules.test.mjs adds a .vibe case per rule (the pipe case fails without the filter); five Go witnesses join FuzzLintRulesMatchTypeScript, whose .vibe and .ts twins agree.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3245\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":127,\"title\":\"test(unplugin): cite current Vibe JSX sidecar contract (VIP-27)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-findings through mq-11032044-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3246\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":128,\"title\":\"fix(lint): warn on form spellings only in effect code\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m3247\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":129,\"title\":\"fix(lint): derive a module body's deterministicKeys key from its .vibe file\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane platform-t3code through mq-11040019-6 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: TestModuleBodyKeysT3codeDesktop (the minimal repro and DesktopNetworkInterfaces' default-pattern key) and FuzzModuleBodyKeys, which compares each body's deterministicKeys reports with its .ts twin over directories, file names (index, class-named), module names, service/error/nested/two-class bodies, key patterns and keys.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3248\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":130,\"title\":\"fix(loader): select the tsconfig that contains each module\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (projfix-smithers): Same owned change with TypeScript composite-reference root-membership correction and minimized regression; 86 focused tests and 300 property cases pass, rebase proof40 passes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane projfix-smithers through mq-11040112-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3249\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":131,\"title\":\"fix(lint): keep grouped Effect hints when edits are unsafe\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\