e\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11040816-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3256\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":138,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): retain concurrent loop source statements\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (maint-sol): conflicts with main in zmkozlop: zmkozlop STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: typescript/tsc/internal/vibelangestree/vibelang.go (AssertionError: ('overlapping line edits', (0, 0, [\\\"// isPatternMatcher recognizes only the parser's subject-capturing arrow at\\\", '// an is keyword.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11040816-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3257\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":139,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): hide synthesized declaration metadata\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11040816-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3258\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":140,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): retain plain error methods beside constructor payloads\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane maint-sol through mq-11040816-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3259\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":141,\"title\":\"fix(lint): require a resolved enabled Effect plugin\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane conf-auto-lint-plugin-implicit-activation through mq-11040816-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: regression reports EK3801 for absent, null-disabled and unrelated plugins. After: the comple