ise coverage through explicit service lookups (VIP-10)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-fix-main-red through mq-11051851-11 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3279\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":161,\"title\":\"fix(bun): preload VibeLang in test-owned build graphs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 12 focused tests pass on Bun 1.4.4 before and after rebase; 183 kernel laws pass during docs regeneration; forms --write is unchanged.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3280\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":162,\"title\":\"fix(lint): follow referenced projects in the Oxlint adapter (VIP-30, VIP-38)\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane drive-alchemy through mq-11051911-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 18 referenced-project regressions fail on the unchanged parent and the excluded-file control passes. The complete Go lint package passes after the fix, including existing fuzz seeds; the fresh native corpus and 64 seeded project-graph variants pass without skips. Repeated after rebase.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3281\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":163,\"title\":\"fix(loader): delegate native modules through JavaScript load hooks\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-node through mq-11051911-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: the unmodified loader fails 4 new checks, including real Playwright config parsing and seeded path properties; the bare Node/child-process control passes. With this change all 22 focused and existing register tests pass, no skips.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3282\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":164,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): honor Rolldown cwd for source bundles\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-rolldown through mq-11051932-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 14 focused tests pass, including 24 fast-check runs; the unmodified parent plugin fails the regression matrix. Native compiler build, forms regeneration (no changed decisions), docs regeneration and 183 kernel checks pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3283\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":165,\"title\":\"fix(loader): map native frames for custom stack formatters\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-node through mq-11052132-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: 4 regressions fail, including both real Playwright config/worker runs reporting generated line 11 for source line 5, generated path/line properties, and structured formatting. After: all 23 focused and existing register tests pass with zero skips.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3284\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":166,\"title\":\"fix(loader): select source conditions for unbuilt Node packages\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-node through mq-11052132-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3285\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":167,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): preload native adapters for Node bundle calls\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (loader-rolldown): conflicts with main in lqqvoqun: lqqvoqun STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: packages/unplugin/src/register-bundler.js packages/unplugin/src/register.d.ts packages/unplugin/test/preload-build.mjs packages/unplugin/test/preload.test.mjs (AssertionError: ('packages/unplugin/test/preload.test.mjs', 'both sides added this file with different content (add/add): merge the two versions by hand')).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-rolldown through mq-11052132-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3286\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":168,\"title\":\"fix(bun): resolve migrated literal build entrypoints\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-bun through mq-11052132-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3287\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":169,\"title\":\"fix(bun): resolve migrated imports in native launchers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-bun through mq-11052132-1 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3288\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":170,\"title\":\"docs(bun): specify the runtime baseline for source loaders\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-bun through mq-11052208-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3289\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":171,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): scan a Bun project inside a dot directory\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane pmred-compiler through mq-11052208-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3290\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":172,\"title\":\"fix(eslint): mark hoisted concurrency limit references as synthetic\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane pmred-cases-3 through mq-11052226-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: the original converter fails the new origin test and the existing synthesized-name test. After: the full ESTree package, twelve origin combinations, keyed syntax/trivia fuzz seeds and vet pass. Add a quoted static oracle and document the source/generated boundary.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3291\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":173,\"title\":\"fix(bun): resolve relative bundle entries from the caller\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-bun through mq-11052326-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3292\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":174,\"title\":\"fix(unplugin): load lazy bundler imports on earlier Bun runtimes\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-rolldown through mq-11052342-9 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: the unchanged published adapter fails 14 of 15 checks on Bun 1.4.2. The fixed adapter passes all 15 on both 1.4.1 and 1.4.2. Current Node/Bun/preload/cwd integration passes 53 checks with no skips.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m3293\",\"epic\":\"e6\",\"rank\":175,\"title\":\"fix(bun): resolve migrated TypeScript paths aliases\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane loader-bun through mq-11060101-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: the new native-launcher regression fails on the parent and passes with the fix for bun run, literal dynamic import, CommonJS and bun test. Both new property tests fail on the parent; 120 generated layout