ts a Schema.TaggedError class no schema error can write\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10310743-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4666\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":68,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): keep Oxlint off the declaration sidecars\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-10310743-2 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4667\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":69,\"title\":\"test(migration): fuzz opencode export and Bun patterns\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migfix-opencode through mq-10310804-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4668\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":70,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): refresh every lockfile and write overrides to every table in upgrade-effect\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311101-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: installCommand with a pnpm/bun/npm mix of lockfiles; planUpgrade on the Smithers shape (both tables, double quotes, package.json text); allowBuilds in a double-quoted block; setJsonOverrides with both tables.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4669\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":71,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): lint .vibe files with the Oxlint configuration each script names\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-10311101-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: tooling.test.mjs wires foldkit's script shapes, a workspace package naming ../../.oxlintrc.app.json, and an app configuration with its own JS plugin, checks each generated config's rules and that wiring twice changes nothing (fails on main), and pins oxlintPasses and eslintConfigName; 15/15 with real ESLint (VIBELANG_TOOLING_NODE_MODULES).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4670\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":72,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): rewrite importers outside the run's sources in codemod and revert\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311101-14 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: a module with importers in test/ and in another package, and a .vibe test written after the codemod; codemod edits all three, revert points them back, and the later .vibe test names ../src/crypto.ts again (main's revert leaves it at .vibe).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4671\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":73,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): keep dprint and ESLint off the sidecars, and pinned dprint plugins pinned\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: a pinned and an unpinned dprint package, three ESLint shapes; main adds the unpinned plugin to the pinned config and no excludes. A second run changes nothing.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4672\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":74,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): format the repository's existing .vibe files in setup\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: a workspace package's .vibe file is formatted, a vendored package's and a .ts file are not.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4673\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":75,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve trailing-slash directory imports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4674\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":76,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): a types export of a renamed module names its sidecar\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: codemod tests for a types field, a types condition and a bare entry, and the exports property test gains the types-condition shape with corpus t3code-types-condition; each fails on the previous library.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4675\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":77,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): verify fails a batch whose declaration emit fails in a migrated file\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: declarations.test.mjs runs a compiler that reports TS7056 in a migrated .vibe file and in an untouched .ts file; only the first is the batch's. It fails on the previous library, which returns no diagnostics.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4676\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":78,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): read CRLF compiler diagnostics\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4677\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":79,\"title\":\"test(migration): fuzz opencode mocks and named configs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migfix-opencode through mq-10311616-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4678\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":80,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the codemod rewrites only imports of and in the modules a batch renames\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311716-32 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: importscope.property.test.mjs (Smithers corpus, and a property over module graphs with earlier .vibe modules and a random batch); both fail on main. Migrate suite 170/170.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4679\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":81,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): warn about source extension allowlists\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-10311829-36 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4680\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":82,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): admit unreachable private declaration additions\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m4681\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":83,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): pair declaration outputs for renamed mts modules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-10311914-39 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4682\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":84,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): load native Vite config dependencies before plugins\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migtool-foldkit through mq-10311914-39 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4683\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":85,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): record formats a batch's .vibe files that jj reports as renamed\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10311914-39 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: renames.property.test.mjs (Smithers corpus line, a real jj rename, and a property over renames, moves, edits, deletions and additions in a real jj repository). Both fail on main.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4684\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":86,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve literal braces in jj rename summaries\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4685\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":87,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): a declaration emit puts back the tracked .d.ts files it rewrote\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): same fix rebased onto main 013cfa002833; release notes now keep main lines.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized opencode layout (corpus opencode-tracked-stray-declarations), and a property over 60 generated sets of tracked and stray declaration files that the repository is unchanged.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4686\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":88,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup leaves every Git submodule as it is\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: property submodules.property.test.mjs (own packages beside one to three submodules, nested submodule directories, packages each workspace names inside them, pnpm and npm workspaces) and corpus alchemy-submodule-workspace; with main's ownedPaths it fails (\\\"setup leaves submodules/distilled/packages/aws/package.json as it is\\\").\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4687\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":89,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): verify matches a test whose name prints a date across runs\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10312008-42 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: testnames.property.test.mjs (Smithers corpus, which main reports missing; a property over dates, spellings, gone and newly failing tests; names without dates unchanged). Migrate suite passes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4688\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":90,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the fix loop puts back an earlier batch's module in another package\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10312023-43 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: codemod.test.mjs \\\"fixToFixedPoint puts back an earlier batch's file in another package that --fix rewrote\\\", with corpus t3code-fix-scope-outside-package.json, fails on main's library; fixscope.property.test.mjs, random package layouts and rewritten sets (seed 1916, 60 runs), checks that exactly the batch's files keep their rewrites; it fails on main's library with an out-of-package file kept.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4689\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":91,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): a tool's config stays .ts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-10312036-44 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Test: plan.test.mjs \\\"t3code: a tool's config stays .ts, in the draft and in a plan that names it\\\" (graphql.config.ts and vitest.config.ts stay; src/config.ts and app.config.loader.ts remain candidates).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4690\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":92,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): skip declaration identity for private packages\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-10312050-45 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: private-before.log fails on unchanged main. After: 170 tests pass. Generated docs updated; forms regeneration is awaiting host Go admission.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4691\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":93,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup removes the declarationSidecars setting an earlier setup wrote\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): same fix rebased onto main 013cfa002833; release notes now keep main lines.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-10312050-45 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the opencode and Smithers shapes; a round-trip property against a verbatim copy of the earlier writer (removing what it wrote restores the file byte for byte, 300 generated tsconfigs); and a placement property for any member position, comments and idempotence.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4692\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":94,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve Oxlint ignore scopes in the ESLint bridge\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-10312050-45 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4693\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":95,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup turns on vibelang-vite's register in the config the tests load\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-10312050-45 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: register.property.test.mjs (Smithers' capability config, and a property over option shapes, an explicit register, idempotence and syntax); wire.test.mjs expectations updated. Migrate suite passes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4694\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":96,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): wire a lint or format command run in parentheses, and make setup's reruns idempotent\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-10312050-45 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: tooling.test.mjs (the foldkit corpus scripts, oxfmt, prettier, mixed; foldkit's triple-layered lint:effect and requoted ignore: one layer, one entry, a second run changes nothing), tooling.property.test.mjs (fast-check over oxlint invocations in and out of subshells with -c/--config spellings, flags and paths: one pass per configuration, the script kept, a second run changes nothing, stale and doubled layers are rewritten; format commands in subshells), wire.test.mjs (ignores in three quote styles).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4695\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":97,\"title\":\"feat(migrate): setup wires vibelang-unplugin into embedded esbuild calls in scripts and sources, never in tests\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane esbuild-flow through mq-11010815-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: setup-leaves-tests.test.mjs runs setup's wiring (wireTarget) on a repository laid out from Smithers' 13 corpus files and checks all 9 test and fixture files stay byte-identical (fails on a27c5a85a9bd); a fast-check property over package layouts (200 runs, 4 mutants killed); wire and esbuild-builds unit tests.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4696\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":98,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve root typecheck project graphs for native checkers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy-2 through mq-11010815-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: alchemy's root command and minimized solution/base corpus; 75 fast-check shell traces preserve argument lists and order. The regression fails on main and passes with the fix. Original stock 7.0.2, stock 7.1.0-beta and the migration fork agree on alchemy's test project.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4697\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":99,\"title\":\"feat(migrate): the codemod moves a module's platform code into <Name>.platform.ts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: platform.property.test.mjs (Smithers corpus: declarations identical under stock TypeScript, no builtin value import left; refusals; a property over generated modules), revert.test.mjs (sibling removed).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4698\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":100,\"title\":\"feat(migrate): the platform split moves declarations that read the host globals EK4402 names\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11010815-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4699\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":101,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): leave a specifier in a comment as written\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11010815-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4700\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":102,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): an ast-grep TypeScript rule leaves the declaration sidecars alone\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the four ignores shapes through wireDeveloperTools; a property over 300 rule texts that the entry is added once and removed exactly; and a real ast-grep scan (opencode node_modules) that reports the finding once, where main reports delete.vibe and delete.d.vibe.ts.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4701\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":103,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the style gate keeps EK4814 on a Schema.TaggedError class it keeps\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code through mq-11010831-4 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: diagnostics.test.mjs, the t3code corpus t3code-schema-constructor-gate.json (the native output for the minimized class) and the cases around it (other class, other file, fixable EK4837); both fail on the library before this change.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4702\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":104,\"title\":\"fix(codemod): preserve explicit empty error payload declarations\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit-2 through mq-11010946-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: four unsafe configurations and the explicit-empty fuzz seed/corpus fail on unchanged main. After: focused tests and existing error twins pass; full short fuzz passes (258.646s), vet passes except the existing excluded copylocks analyzer.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4703\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":105,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): lint VibeLang in Oxlint file-list runners\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 183 migration tests pass, 4 unrelated opt-in checks skip; 150 selector properties and 80 native-rule differential cases pass; docs regenerated. No language or public package API change.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4704\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":106,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): lint directories containing only VibeLang\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[]},{\"id\":\"m4705\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":107,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve Oxlint lint directives\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane oxc-opencode through mq-11010946-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4706\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":108,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): route unchanged bundler consumers to existing emitted modules\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migtool-foldkit through mq-11010946-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: literal Foldkit Rolldown corpus and real installed Vite both fail on the unwired native graph and pass through the emitted imports with the same consumer commands. The 100-run exact-source property and 20 real compiler/Node Unicode/nested-path executions preserve selected identities.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4707\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":109,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): reject toolchain regressions before adopting baselines\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-11010946-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4708\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":110,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the inventory records imports through a tsconfig paths alias\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-2 through mq-11010946-3 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: test/aliases.test.mjs with corpus t3code-path-alias-inventory.json (apps/web's `<path>` → `./src/*`, edges both ways), resolveAlias's precedence rules, and a fast-check property whose oracle is ts.resolveModuleName under Bundler resolution (80 runs; 400 runs agree).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4709\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":111,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): name Vibe sources in stock TypeScript imports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): carried by f710203d, which adds the published-specifier excuse the opencode agent decided at 19:58Z on top of it.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4710\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":112,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): verify excuses a published specifier that names the same declaration\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): carried by the opencode-19/31/39 stack ending 27f142dedd08.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized stats/core barrel (corpus opencode-published-extensionless-barrel), a different file, a missing target, a directory shadow, a bare name, a type change and a reordering, and a property over 150 generated barrels in four import forms with byte mutations.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4711\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":113,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the codemod names a migrated module through a paths alias too\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): release note reworded per train-bun-guard: the project bun check script invoking stock TypeScript (spec-bun-sidecar-check).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11011331-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized opencode app (corpus opencode-app-alias-importer), where stock TypeScript resolves each rewritten alias to the sidecar and revert restores both importers; a property over 200 generated projects (four alias shapes including an extended config with baseUrl, four specifier forms, .ts and .vibe importers) with the same stock-TypeScript oracle.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4712\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":114,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): a toolchain switch runs the earlier compiler's VIP migrations first\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11011331-5 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized opencode helper (corpus opencode-vip1-unmarked-helper) through upgradeEffect with a stand-in com