 docs/forms all pass.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4738\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":140,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): certify formatted declarations before recording\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (migflow-foldkit): conflicts with main in ymtuzzpr: ymtuzzpr STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: .smithers/flows/migrate/lib/steps.mjs (AssertionError: ('overlapping edits', (141, 141, 'testDiff, '), (141, 141, 'verificationRefreshed, '))).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migflow-foldkit): record guard retained in this sixteen-commit flow stack with the tested build and selector guards.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4739\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":141,\"title\":\"test(migrate): initialize declaration guard fixtures as Jujutsu repositories\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane fuzz-migflow-foldkit through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4740\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":142,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup under --no-wire wires a package the run adds\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-2): same change rebased onto main 9759d61e (hand-resolved conflicts; box flow suite matches main); --no-wire with no wired package now wires nothing, as foldkit-104 needs.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-2 through mq-11012034-16 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: test/no-wire.test.mjs wires the t3code shape (a wired packages/contracts and an unwired oxlint-plugin-t3code) and checks the plugin gets ../.vibelang-toolchain tarballs, vibelang for tsc and .vibe includes, the wired package stays byte-identical and a rerun is a no-op; the refusal; and a fast-check property that a rebased file: specifier resolves to the same file from the new directory and any other specifier is kept.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4741\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":143,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): an unused private type alias is no declaration change in a file nothing publishes\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: test/private-types.test.mjs with corpus t3code-private-schema-alias.json (canonical comparison; compareDeclarations calls the pair identical only when no file is published; main's declarations.mjs calls it different), the aliases that stay part of the contract, and a fast-check property over chains of private aliases, named and unnamed.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4742\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":144,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the order of a declaration file's imports is no change\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-2): same change rebased onto main 9759d61e (hand-resolved conflicts; box flow suite matches main); published files stay byte for byte (done criterion 3): the unused-alias waiver applies only to files nothing publishes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-2 through mq-11012053-17 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: private-types.test.mjs with corpus t3code-import-order.json (the attachment toolkit's pair), what stil