.build configs plus a refusal property for non-array plugins.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4746\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":148,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup wires electron-vite builds and Vite worker builds\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): carried by the opencode-21/29/42 stack ending a9d4c986fe19.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized desktop config; the worker shapes, a refusal and idempotence; worker detection; a property over 200 generated electron-vite configs whose insertions alone separate them from the original.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4747\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":149,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): a build script's Bun shell runs vibelang where it ran tsc\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Rejected in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): conflicts with main in xrtpvzuu: xrtpvzuu STOP: non-generated conflicts need a hand: .smithers/flows/migrate/lib/wire.mjs (AssertionError: ('overlapping line edits', (0, 0, ['/**', ' * The root owns solution builds even when only leaf packages are migrated.', ' * Replace the checker).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11012213-21 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: the minimized opencode build script through replaceTscInScript and wireBunBuilds; a property over 300 generated scripts with tsc sites and decoys, and idempotence.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4748\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":150,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup wires a Vite config through as any, and warns for one it cannot\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-opencode): same fix rebased 