759d61e (hand-resolved conflicts; box flow suite matches main); extensionless mocks follow main D298.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-2): same fix rebased onto main 4d8c221e: 104ca92d conflicted in lib/imports.mjs with the comment-specifier fix 764386b8.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-2 through mq-11012342-25 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: test/test-mocks.test.mjs: the t3code repro shape (rewrite and revert, a mock of an unrenamed module and an extensionless one left as written), what counts as a mock call, and a fast-check property over mock APIs, extensions and quotes that each mock names what the import of the same path names and revert restores the file byte for byte.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4762\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":164,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): let eslint-plugin-import read a .vibe module's exports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: wire and tooling tests (fail without the fix), a real-ESLint test that every VibeLang export form reaches import/named and import/namespace over 24 seeded module shapes, and the Smithers corpus smithers-eslint-import-namespace-vibe.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4763\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":165,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): put setup's ESLint entries before an array method's result\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-smithers through mq-11012342-25 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: wire.test.mjs (fails without the fix) loads the rewritten configuration and checks the list, plus parentheses inside strings, comments and templates; corpus smithers-eslint-ignore-flatmap.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4764\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":166,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the codemod refuses a module whose .vibe path is ignored\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11012342-25 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: fuzz-findings' ignored-renames.property.test.mjs (nested paths, ignore kinds, stems and bytes in real jj repositories) with its known failure removed from corpus alchemy-ignored-source-rename.json; they fail on main.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4765\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":167,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve returned callback failure contracts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migflow-foldkit through mq-11020026-28 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4766\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":168,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): gate earlier VIP fixes on the probed VIP-1 flip\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane vipgate-opencode through mq-11020036-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4767\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":169,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): repair setup --no-wire package wiring\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane rd8-setup-no-wire through mq-11020036-29 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: the t3code witness and both new tests fail with a stack overflow on main 8b690d5fb064. After: 48 focused wiring/setup tests pass, including the 100-workspace property and 300 relative-specifier trials.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4768\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":170,\"title\":\