ts, 40 generated layouts and the minimized Alchemy corpus. Fresh regeneration and 183 kernel tests pass. Official forms --write adds only previously missing upstream case sites, with no existing decision moves.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4892\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":294,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): refresh declaration exports after sidecar relocation\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11030828-15 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: native TypeScript consumer exits 0 before setup, fails TS2307 after unmodified setup, and exits 0 after the repair. Full setup regression plus 200 fast-check layout variants and opencode minimized corpus pass. Runtime targets and unrelated metadata remain unchanged.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4893\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":295,\"title\":\"test(migrate): refresh the Alchemy source-sidecar citation\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: the unmodified full target reports the citation failure. After rebase onto vibe a1dd99e9, the focused suite passes 6 tests and its 200 generated JSONC cases, with 1 optional native integration skip. Docs regeneration, 183 kernel tests and forms write pass, no forms changes.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4894\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":296,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): recognize implicit build-mode projects\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane drive-foldkit through mq-11030903-24 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4895\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":297,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): exclude declaration sidecars from emitted imports\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"