d generated pages.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4899\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":301,\"title\":\"test(migrate): match VIP-39 project selector counterparts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fix5-migrate through mq-11030926-32 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: the unmodified current-base property fails; the corrected property and 300 generated cases pass on cfbox 848feee3, with zero skips. Include release notes and the generated page.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4900\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":302,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): give the VIP upgrade notice its own paragraph\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fix5-migrate through mq-11030926-32 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: the original upgrade regression fails on the unmodified base. All 20 upgrade/message tests pass; the refreshed focused check passes 5/5, with no skips. Flow docs, release notes and generated site page updated.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4901\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":303,\"title\":\"test(migrate): track the current module-identity citation\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fix5-migrate through mq-11031009-41 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4902\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":304,\"title\":\"test(migrate): serve published Effect in SDK registry fixtures\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-fix5-migrate through mq-11031009-41 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Bef