erge queue from lane toolfix-t3code through mq-11031109-53 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4906\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":308,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): verify and record accept sidecars under vibe.sidecarDir\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-11031214-64 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4907\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":309,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preload native sources in Bun test fixture children\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11031214-64 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Before: four of five minimized regression/property checks fail.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"After: 52/52 checks pass on rebased d77c2c37, including both nested Vitest and Bun wiring, 36 generated Bun layouts and a real Bun/native-syntax load that fails before setup and passes after. Existing test bytes unchanged.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4908\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":310,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): setup and codemod cover vite.config.<name>.ts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-foldkit through mq-11031214-64 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4909\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":311,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): compare published APIs through saved declaration layouts\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: the first eight valid controls fail the original byte gate; formatting/order/alias rewrites pass while names, types and JSDoc remain gated. Includes generated migration properties and pinned real-repo corpus con