ipts.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4914\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":316,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): discover fix scope through repairable parser errors\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-alchemy through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4915\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":317,\"title\":\"feat(migrate): fail verify on a function that lost an Effect wrapper\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane revscan-flow through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4916\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":318,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): ESLint and Knip read .vibe in a repository that runs them itself\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (toolfix-smithers): same fix rebased onto vibe 246fafceaa22 (release-notes conflict kept both); the refused files are base drift, not edits of this commit.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane toolfix-smithers through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4917\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":319,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): node --test and Smithers Node runtimes load vibelang/register\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane toolfix2-smithers through mq-11031353-8 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Tests: test/node-tests.test.mjs (Smithers corpus, unit cases, a 400-run property over Runtime.Node literals, and a wireTarget setup test that fails without the steps.mjs wiring).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4918\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":320,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): pin B