\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (tooling-rd16): Carries all three recovered RD fixes, rebased onto published vibe 5d47acdb5209, plus a separate packaged Bun export-inspection refactor to remove the registration hotspot.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (tooling-rd16): Recovered by fix-tooling-rd16: preserves the original three fixes, all additional authored tests and latest native export/standalone-map repairs; resolves current registration/exported-test-support conflicts and repairs the lost-wrapper map fixture.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane tooling-rd16 through mq-11032044-30 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 85 focused/native/property tests pass with zero skips; 183 kernel tests and generated docs pass. Setup/install e2e and the release tarball file-coverage check pass. Broad canonical gate is pending. Recovery source tip: 3749c41913ec; enqueue separately after that stack lands.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4944\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":346,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): refresh canonically formatted source-child helpers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11032109-33 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4945\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":347,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): reuse named imports in source-child helpers\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-opencode through mq-11032148-38 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 76 source-child tests pass with no skips after rebuilding the native compiler and forms binary from the published base.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4946\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":348,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): use the full project for oversized import closures\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-shardcap through mq-11032150-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Regression: the t3code 369-module TSX pattern, a real onePassStep integration with a 242-module closure and an unselected observer, and 200 fast-check closure/cap/cycle/order cases. All three fail without the code fix; the property shrinks to cap 1 with a two-module closure.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4947\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":349,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): record stock API oracles for opted-in private packages\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-verify): Complete four-fix stack retains this private-package oracle change unchanged; no edits dropped.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-verify): Complete four-fix stack retains these private-oracle and D298 changes unchanged; no edits dropped.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"tried\",\"text\":\"Superseded in the merge queue (migfix-t3code-verify): Original complete four-fix stack 6088aab24111 landed at 22:01:26Z in 7a28b6a5e65d; refreshed duplicate retains the same four fixes, so no edits remain to land.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane migfix-t3code-verify through mq-11032150-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4948\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":350,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): keep declaration sidecars out of published packages\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane flow-sidecar-pack through mq-11032150-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: 56 relevant tooling tests pass, 1 skipped; expanded packing suite 30 pass with 36 generated files/exports/publishConfig shapes; rebased focused suite 10 pass. Kernel 183 tests pass; docs regen and forms --write pass, with no existing call-form decision moved.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4949\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":351,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): the platform split reads EK4402 text for a derived host global\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane platform-smithers through mq-11032150-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4950\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":352,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): verify cold constructor binding provenance\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane conf-auto-run-phase-binding-provenance through mq-11032150-40 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4951\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":353,\"title\":\"fix(migrate): preserve native rewrite options during setup\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane conf-auto-setup-native-rewrite-option through mq-11032221-44 (matched by title).\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"},{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Validation: baseline regression fails true !== false and true !== undefined.\",\"by\":\"bootstrap\"}]},{\"id\":\"m4952\",\"epic\":\"e10\",\"rank\":354,\"title\":\"test(migrate): preserve valid pack prerequisites in baseline fixtures\",\"state\":\"landed\",\"task\":\"\",\"lane\":\"\",\"notes\":[{\"section\":\"evidence\",\"text\":\"Landed by the merge queue from lane main-red-pmfix-legacy through mq-11032340-1 (matched by title).\